{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/3381","id":4047918999,"node_id":"PR_kwDOEFLz887xRleX","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3381","diff_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3381.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3381.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/3381","number":3381,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(policy): validate reauth tags against the authenticating user","user":{"login":"maximilize","id":3752128,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NTIxMjg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3752128?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximilize","html_url":"https://github.com/maximilize","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximilize/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximilize/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximilize/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximilize/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximilize/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximilize/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximilize/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximilize/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maximilize/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- [x] have read the [CONTRIBUTING.md](./CONTRIBUTING.md) file\n- [x] raised a GitHub issue or discussed it on the projects chat beforehand (#3374)\n- [x] added unit tests\n- [ ] added integration tests (pure policy/state logic, covered by a unit test)\n- [ ] updated documentation if needed (no user-facing doc change)\n- [x] updated CHANGELOG.md\n\nFixes #3374.\n\n## Problem\n\nRe-authenticating an **already tagged** node with `--advertise-tags` is always rejected with `requested tags [...] are invalid or not permitted`, even when the authenticating user owns every requested tag (and even for tags the node already holds). Because `--force-reauth` has already rotated the node's keys, the node is left logged out until an untagged re-auth or an admin-side `headscale nodes tag`.\n\nThe neighbouring cases work: initial registration of a new node with `--advertise-tags`, and re-auth of a *user-owned* node. Only the tagged→tagged transition fails.\n\n## Root cause\n\n`applyAuthNodeUpdate` validates the requested tags against the **existing node** (`state.go`, `validateRequestTags(params.ExistingNode, ...)`), and `PolicyManager.NodeCanHaveTag` can only approve a tag two ways: the node's IP is in the tag owner's node set, or the node's own user owns the tag. A tag-owned node has neither — its `UserID`/`User` are nil and its IP is not in any owner's set — so every tag is rejected. The **authenticating user**, who actually owns the tags, is never consulted.\n\nThe fresh-registration path does not hit this because `createAndSaveNewNode` assigns the authenticating user to the node *before* validating, so the user check succeeds. (Root cause diagnosed in the issue by @fredrikekre; confirmed at `0483085`.)\n\n## Fix\n\nAuthorise the requested tags against the authenticating user on re-auth, mirroring fresh registration:\n\n- add `PolicyManager.UserCanHaveTag(user, tag)` — the user half of `NodeCanHaveTag` (is the user one of the tag's owners);\n- `applyAuthNodeUpdate` now validates via `validateRequestTagsForReauth`, which permits a tag when the existing node may hold it **or** the authenticating user owns it.\n\nTags the authenticating user does not own are still rejected, so this authorises the user, it does not skip authorisation.\n\n## Test\n\n`TestTaggedReauthValidatesAgainstAuthUser` (`hscontrol/state/issue_3374_test.go`) seeds a genuinely tag-owned node (created under another user, then tagged with `UserID`/`User` nil) and re-auths it as the tag owner: re-advertising an owned tag is now accepted and the node stays tagged, while a tag owned by a different user is still rejected. It fails before the change and passes after; the full `hscontrol/state` and `hscontrol/policy/...` suites stay green.\n","created_at":"2026-07-13T21:31:05Z","updated_at":"2026-07-28T09:55:19Z","closed_at":"2026-07-28T09:55:19Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"958cea6bb8d8bb35c9f426ff5e9ad3ab02e136dc","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},{"login":"nblock","id":131119,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMTExOQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131119?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock","html_url":"https://github.com/nblock","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblock/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nblo